Apple yesterday <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/09/apple-debuts-iphone-18-pro-and-iphone-18-pro-max/">announced</a> the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a> and &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max, succeeding the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17-pro/">iPhone 17 Pro</a> that launched last September. The new models are built around the A20 Pro chip, a 48-megapixel Fusion Main camera with variable aperture, a redesigned vapor chamber, and a smaller <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/dynamic-island/">Dynamic Island</a>.<br/>
<br/>
